# Platform: mobilesite
# Tags: sample
# Purpose: shows if / else, for each row (with a row range) and repeat, using the city_search data set
open https://www.justdial.com
wait for page to load
for each row in city_search rows 1 to 3
if ${platform} is mobilesite
verify page contains "Justdial"
else if ${city} is Delhi
verify page title contains "Justdial"
skip to next row
else
verify page title contains "Justdial"
end if
stop loop if ${city} is Pune
end for
repeat 2 times
scroll down
end repeat
if platform is mobilesite
verify page contains "Justdial"
end if
